        "original_id": "0aabdb87-c35c-5427-9f20-8d6b924856ec",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Robbie Tucker, Fenmore Baldwin, Max Ehrich\n- Works: It's Always Sunny in Philadelphia, Criminal Minds, FlashForward\n- Concepts: The Gang, Paddy's Pub\n\nFacts:\n- Robbie Tucker was born on April 5, 2001, and he is an American actor.\n- Robbie Tucker appeared in the series Criminal Minds, FlashForward, and It's Always Sunny in Philadelphia.\n- In It's Always Sunny in Philadelphia, \"The Gang\" are debauched, self-centered friends who run the Irish bar Paddy's Pub in South Philadelphia.\n- Fenmore Baldwin was initially portrayed by various child actors, including Robbie Tucker.\n- In 2012, Fenmore Baldwin was rapidly aged to a teenager, and Max Ehrich assumed the role.",
